<p>NOTE: Analysts consensus for the quarter was $0.76 per share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The company said three events resulted in a second quarter charge of $3.90 per share.</p>
<p>Dow Chemical Co bought Lilly's 40 percent interest in DowElanco for about $1.2 billion, resulting in a one-time after-tax gain of $296 million.  A special, noncash charge of about $2.4 billion was taken to write down the carrying value of the PCS health-care- management businesses. A settlement was reached regarding a portion of the company's remaining retail pharmacy pricing litigation. Excluding those events, net income was $0.76 per share.</p>
